r can record the first original's updated target byte and sibling just after that loan closes, then reuse that same named target Copy as the standby writer's actual. The target is read once. Both originals remain independently live, have the same nominal and use the same declared target field position. The bounded support covers 0→0 and 1→1, both guard outcomes and the named or direct-tail writer.\n\nThe ordinary checker and call replay retain the exact first Change, source order, per-original fields, second actual, old bytes and teardown. Mixed-index snapshots and stale, sibling or crossed-original actuals stay refused at C17; lexical escape stays refused at CHECK. Inherited repeat-read and displaced-copy controls retain their C17 bytes.\n\n## Fixed evidence\n\n- HEAD `cc4ec8e207b27f6eceb9a8bf1786cb4fadb62f4c`, tree `5284d393392023e03bb0266dc6de2e872f45c8e1`, sole parent `94b35584081a80ab5e302fd9e237a95beb95ba66` (Draft17.38). Full-index diff covers 12 paths, 21,276 B and SHA-256 `78c557ebec95a18bb801b54b8a38660d5e0df5c564225032ef046b7ac56d0d4d`.\n- Both unchanged pins first refused the two snapshot cases at C17 after CHECK0. On this candidate they emit and reach native. The two integrated compilers matched all 11 CLI rows, with the original refusal and refusal output-preservation evidence kept. The candidate passed 60 strict native runs, and the separately compiled C reference passed 30. [Frozen FIRST](https://github.com/wakairo/NewLang_Compiler/issues/1794#issuecomment-7160855233) · [Exact local report](https://github.com/wakairo/NewLang_Compiler/issues/1794#issuecomment-7161204248)\n- Selected root CTest passed 10/10 each in GCC Release and Clang ASan/LSan+UBSan. Snapshot rollback exercised 1,632 CHECK allocation failures, including 16 existing seal sites, and 2,479 named-output failures for each destination state. Exact rollback, no-clobber and retry ran under effective 180 s. [FIRST, transport failure and original Gate0 archive](https://github.com/wakairo/NewLang_Evidence/tree/ea326bd24e40d39c16dbd3bd475a2e49b8004f9e/p1794/gate0)\n\nRefs #1794. [C DRAFT GO](https://github.com/wakairo/NewLang_Compiler/issues/1794#issuecomment-7161225266)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T11:40:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:40:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"365dc639f694f25e32ad17bdd9ada8530d1be79a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"wakairo:p1794-early-field-copy","ref":"p1794-early-field-copy","repo":{"id":1404213211,"node_id":"R_kgDOU7KX2w","name":"NewLang_Compiler","full_name":"wakairo/NewLang_Compiler","owner":{"login":"wakairo","id":6393110,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTMxMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6393110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo","html_url":"https://github.com/wakairo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakairo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"C","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":279,"open_issues":279,"size":246972,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":fa